  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the pork shoulder into thin strips.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, garlic, ginger, and sriracha.",
    "Add the sliced pork to the bowl and marinate for 10 minutes.",
    "Place the marinated pork on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake the pork in the preheated oven for 15 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the buns by baking them in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "Spread a layer of kimchi on each toasted bun.",
    "Add a few slices of the cooked pork on top of the kimchi.",
    "Sprinkle chopped scallions and a drizzle of sesame oil on top of the pork."
  ],
